### ============================================================================
### File: docs/api-tests/03-warehouses.http
### Purpose: Manual and automated HTTP requests for Module 3 (Warehouses: UC-11 to UC-13)
### Compatible with: VS Code REST Client, Thunder Client, and IntelliJ HTTP Client
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@adminEmail = admin@mygodown.com
@adminPassword = AdminPassword123!
@managerEmail = manager@mygodown.com
@managerPassword = ManagerPassword123!
@staffEmail = staff@mygodown.com
@staffPassword = StaffPassword123!

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Authenticate as Administrator
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### Store token
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Authenticate as Warehouse Manager
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name managerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{managerEmail}}",
  "password": "{{managerPassword}}"
}

### Store token
@managerToken = {{managerLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Authenticate as Staff
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "{{staffEmail}}",
  "password": "{{staffPassword}}"
}

### Store token
@staffToken = {{staffLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. [UC-11] Create Warehouse (Admin Only - Happy Path)
### Expect: 201 Created, warehouse details in camelCase
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createWarehouse
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Midwest Distribution Center",
  "code": "WH-MIDWEST",
  "city": "Kansas City",
  "address": "1200 Logistics Parkway",
  "isActive": true
}

### Store created warehouse ID
@createdWarehouseId = {{createWarehouse.response.body.data.id}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. [UC-11] Create Warehouse - Duplicate Code (409 Conflict)
### Expect: 409 Conflict, CONFLICT code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createWarehouseDuplicateCode
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate Code Warehouse",
  "code": "WH-MIDWEST",
  "city": "Kansas City"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. [UC-11] Create Warehouse - Validation Error (400 Bad Request)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request, VALIDATION_ERROR code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createWarehouseValidationError
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Incomplete Warehouse"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. [UC-11] Create Warehouse - Forbidden for Manager (403 Forbidden)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createWarehouseManagerForbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Manager Attempt Warehouse",
  "code": "WH-MGR-DENIED",
  "city": "Denver"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. [UC-11] Create Warehouse - Forbidden for Staff (403 Forbidden)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createWarehouseStaffForbidden
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Staff Attempt Warehouse",
  "code": "WH-STF-DENIED",
  "city": "Austin"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. [UC-11] Create Warehouse - Unauthenticated (401 Unauthorized)
### Expect: 401 Unauthorized, UNAUTHORIZED code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name createWarehouseUnauth
POST {{baseUrl}}/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Unauth Warehouse",
  "code": "WH-NOAUTH",
  "city": "Miami"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 10. [UC-12] List Warehouses (All Authenticated Roles - Staff Access)
### Expect: 200 OK, paginated list of warehouses with totalStock and productCount
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name listWarehousesStaff
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 11. [UC-12] Search Warehouses by Keyword
### Expect: 200 OK, filtered results matching name, code, or city
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name searchWarehouses
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses?search=Central
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 12. [UC-12] Filter Warehouses by City
### Expect: 200 OK, filtered results matching city
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name filterWarehousesByCity
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses?city=Chicago
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 13. [UC-12] Get Warehouse by ID (Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, warehouse details with aggregated stock counts
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getWarehouseById
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 14. [UC-12] Get Warehouse by ID - 404 Unknown Warehouse
### Expect: 404 Not Found, NOT_FOUND code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name getWarehouseNotFound
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 15. [UC-13] Update Warehouse Details (Admin Only - Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, updated warehouse details
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name updateWarehouse
PUT {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/{{createdWarehouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Midwest Distribution Center (Expanded)",
  "address": "1250 Logistics Parkway, Suite 200"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 16. [UC-13] Update Warehouse - Code Immutability Violation (400 Bad Request)
### Expect: 400 Bad Request, VALIDATION_ERROR code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name updateWarehouseCodeImmutable
PUT {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/{{createdWarehouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "code": "WH-MIDWEST-NEW"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 17. [UC-13] Update Warehouse - Forbidden for Staff (403 Forbidden)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name updateWarehouseStaffForbidden
PUT {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/{{createdWarehouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Staff Rename Attempt"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 18. [UC-13] Deactivate Warehouse - Blocked When Warehouse Holds Stock (BR-08)
### Expect: 422 Unprocessable Entity, UNPROCESSABLE_ENTITY code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name deactivateWarehouseBlockedByStock
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 19. [UC-13] Deactivate Warehouse - Forbidden for Manager (403 Forbidden)
### Expect: 403 Forbidden, FORBIDDEN code
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name deactivateWarehouseManagerForbidden
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/{{createdWarehouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 20. [UC-13] Soft-Deactivate Empty Warehouse (Admin Only - Happy Path)
### Expect: 200 OK, isActive: false
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name deactivateWarehouseSuccess
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/{{createdWarehouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 21. Verify Inactive Warehouse is Hidden from Staff (404 Not Found)
### Expect: 404 Not Found
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name verifyInactiveWarehouseHiddenFromStaff
GET {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/{{createdWarehouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 22. [UC-13] Reactivate Warehouse (Admin Setting isActive: true)
### Expect: 200 OK, isActive: true
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# @name reactivateWarehouse
PUT {{baseUrl}}/warehouses/{{createdWarehouseId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}
